[*]
[*] VCPU-8 waveform view for `make -C hardware/rtl/vcpu8 wave`; see docs/hardware/simulation-guide.md.
[*] Open it from hardware/rtl/vcpu8:  gtkwave build/waves/wave-demo.fst tb/wave/vcpu8.gtkw
[*] The ^N lines name GTKWave translate filters (tb/wave/*.txt, generated from the RTL packages by
[*] `pnpm --filter @vcpu/rtl-tools cli gen-wave-filters`); `make wave-check` checks every signal below.
[*] GTKWave finds each filter at its path relative to [savefile], that is, beside this file, so it
[*] does not matter which directory GTKWave is started from.
[*]
